[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Parsing Rules
[/meta]

h1. Parsing Rules

Tests for Section 22 of the specification.

h2. Literal Output

h3. Overlapping inline formatting {#parsing-overlap}
[code om]
*_bad overlap*_
[/code]
[code html]
<p>*_bad overlap*_</p>
[/code]

h3. Tag casing {#parsing-tag-case}
[code om]
[Note]
Text
[/Note]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[Note]<br>
Text<br>
[/Note]</p>
[/code]

h3. Reserved tags in the wrong case are text {#parsing-reserved-case}
[code om]
[Alert]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[Alert]</p>
[/code]

h3. Space after the opening bracket {#parsing-tag-space-before}
[code om]
[ note]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[ note]</p>
[/code]

h3. Space before the closing bracket {#parsing-tag-space-after}
[code om]
[note ]
[/code]
[code html]
<p>[note ]</p>
[/code]

h3. Unknown tags are text {#parsing-unknown-tags}
[code om]
See [foo] and [/about].
[/code]
[code html]
<p>See [foo] and [/about].</p>
[/code]

h2. Raw HTML

h3. Script tags are escaped {#parsing-html-script}
[code om]
<script>alert('xss')</script>
[/code]
[code html]
<p>&lt;script&gt;alert('xss')&lt;/script&gt;</p>
[/code]

h3. Inline tags are escaped {#parsing-html-inline}
[code om]
Some <b>bold</b> text.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Some &lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; text.</p>
[/code]

h3. HTML in a code span is escaped {#parsing-html-code-span}
[code om]
Use `<b>` for bold.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Use <code>&lt;b&gt;</code> for bold.</p>
[/code]

h3. Quotes in a URL cannot break out of the attribute {#parsing-html-url-quote}
[code om]
[x]:https://example.com/"onmouseover=alert(1)
[/code]
[code html]
<p><a href="https://example.com/&quot;onmouseover=alert(1)">x</a></p>
[/code]

h3. Character references are escaped {#parsing-html-entities}
[code om]
&copy; 2026 &amp; more
[/code]
[code html]
<p>&amp;copy; 2026 &amp;amp; more</p>
[/code]

h2. Errors

h3. Stray closing tag {#parsing-stray-close}
[code om]
Text.

[/note]
[/code]
[code error]
mismatched-tag 3
[/code]

h3. Closing tag after text {#parsing-close-after-text}
[code om]
[quote]
Text.[/quote]
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 2
[/code]

h3. Closing tag before text {#parsing-close-before-text}
[code om]
[quote]
Text.
[/quote] More.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 3
[/code]

h3. Unclosed block tag {#parsing-unclosed}
[code om]
[quote]
Text.
[/code]
[code error]
unclosed-block 1
[/code]

h3. Mismatched closing tag {#parsing-mismatched}
[code om]
[note]
Text.
[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
mismatched-tag 3
[/code]

h3. Outer block closed while an inner one is open {#parsing-mismatched-inner-open}
[code om]
[more Title]
[note]
Text.
[/more]
[/code]
[code error]
mismatched-tag 4
[/code]

h3. Block tag mid-line {#parsing-block-mid-line}
[code om]
Some text [quote]Invalid[/quote]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. Block language tag after text {#parsing-block-lang-mid-line}
[code om]
Some text [lang uk]
Текст українською.
[/lang]
[/code]
[code error]
block-tag-mid-line 1
[/code]

h3. The first error is reported {#parsing-first-error}
[code om]
[alert]
Text.
[/alert]

[verse]
[/code]
[code error]
reserved-tag 1
[/code]

h2. Reserved Tags

h3. Alert {#parsing-reserved-alert}
[code om]
[alert]
Your session will expire.
[/alert]
[/code]
[code error]
reserved-tag 1
[/code]

h3. Verse {#parsing-reserved-verse}
[code om]
[verse]
Line one
[/verse]
[/code]
[code error]
reserved-tag 1
[/code]

h3. Center {#parsing-reserved-center}
[code om]
[center]
Text.
[/center]
[/code]
[code error]
reserved-tag 1
[/code]

h3. Endnote reference {#parsing-reserved-endnote-ref}
[code om]
A claim[en1].
[/code]
[code error]
reserved-tag 1
[/code]

h3. Abbreviation {#parsing-reserved-abbr}
[code om]
The [abbr HTML]HyperText Markup Language[/abbr] spec.
[/code]
[code error]
reserved-tag 1
[/code]
